        {
          "chunk_index": 1,
          "chunk_id": "s05_c01",
          "anchor_id": "cue_s05_c1_patchrot_works_follows_take_input",
          "text": "PatchRot works as follows. Take an input image and either rotate the whole image, or rotate each of its patches independently, by a random multiple of ninety degrees: zero, ninety, one-eighty, or two-seventy.",
