          "chunk_id": "s05_c02",
          "anchor_id": "cue_s05_c2_vision_transformer_trained_predict_t",
          "text": "The vision transformer is then trained to predict these rotation angles as a simple four-way classification. The transformer's class token, which normally predicts the object category, is repurposed to predict the whole-image rotation, capturing global structure.",
