          "chunk_id": "s05_c04",
          "anchor_id": "cue_s05_c4_happens_reduced_resolution_extra_pat",
          "text": "Training happens at a reduced resolution; then the extra patch heads are removed and the network is fine-tuned at full resolution on the real classification task, with positional embeddings interpolated to the larger patch count.",
